# Configuration file for scx-scheds.
#
# This file is read by scx tooling to determine which scheduler to load
# and what options to pass to it. See the individual scheduler documentation
# at https://github.com/sched-ext/scx for supported flags.
#
# The scheduler to load. Must be the name of one of the scx_* binaries
# installed under /usr/bin. Leave unset to require an explicit scheduler
# argument on the command line.
#SCX_SCHEDULER="scx_bpfland"

# Additional flags passed verbatim to the scheduler binary.
#SCX_FLAGS=""
